[Group "1...d5: the Queen's Gambit"]
[Opening "Queen's Gambit"]
[ECO "D06"]
[Diagram "2.c4"]
[Course "queens-gambit"]
[Page "qg"]

{White offers the c-pawn to lure Black's d-pawn away from the center. Black declines it with 2...e6 or 2...c6, or accepts it with 2...dxc4.}
1. d4 d5 2. c4 {This is the Queen's Gambit.} *

[Chapter "Indian Defenses"]
